      "alt": "Starterkit STKa65xx",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex®-A53 based on AM65xx</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa65xx is an evaluation kit designed for embedded computing engineers. It is built on the TQMa65xx platform, featuring the Arm Cortex-A53 processor from AM65xx. This kit excels in high-speed communication with up to 6x real-time GBit Ethernet, 1x Gbit Ethernet, 4x USB 2.0, and 2x CAN-FD support, making it suitable for industrial applications. It also boasts graphics capabilities, low power consumption (typically 6W), 2x integrated RF5 controllers, IEEE 1588 hardware support, and security functions, ensuring reliability and efficiency in demanding embedded systems.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 23:33:53 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
